THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

binaries/ and tools/loader/ contain byte-patched derivatives of Ubuntu
24.04 (glibc 2.39) binaries:

  ld-linux-aarch64.so.1.orig   unmodified Ubuntu arm64 ld.so
  ld-embedded.so               ld.so + one extra PT_LOAD (the Rust path shim)
  libc-nop.so.6                libc.so.6 with two svc sites nop'ed
  libpath_shim.so              the standalone build of the shim, pre-embedding

glibc is distributed under the GNU LGPL v2.1 (and GPL v2 for parts); the
corresponding source is the Ubuntu 24.04 source package for glibc 2.39, and the
modifications made here are limited to the byte edits described in
docs/design/runtime.md and the evidence files. These binaries
exist in this repository only to pin the identity (sha256) of the artefacts under
test. They are not distributed to anyone outside this private repository.

tools/probe-app/gradle/ contains the Gradle wrapper
(Apache License 2.0, Copyright the Gradle authors).
